I'd rather see this refactored so that `openURL` is set to either an issue or a pr and `OpenInBrowser` is called only once. Additionally the `printPrPreview` and `printIssuePreview` function can be picked dynamically. something like

```go
var printFunc func()

// ... later, if it was actually a PR
printFunc = func () {
  printPrPreview(out, pr)
}

// or if it was an issue
printFunc = func() {
  printIssuePreview(out, issue)
}
```
